802	/**
803	 * Refund a per-server disk expansion that was paid for but never delivered.
804	 *
805	 * The DISK_EXPAND handler advances `Server.extraDiskGB` only AFTER the disk has
806	 * really grown, so that field is the ground truth for "did the customer get what
807	 * they paid for". We refund only when it never reached the job's target — which
